<!-- Escort trucks (slots 2-5, Behavior Escort). Each asks the truck ahead of it in the chain for its one escort place (per route triggers in Convoy-Routes.sbc) and follows it with dampeners off. The lead halts them at the gate or road end (WW2-Convoy-Action-Halt): they leave the slot, stop and deliver like the lead. A truck whose leader is lost, or that gets no place within 60 s, is stranded: it stops (Passive, dampeners off), tells its own escort to do the same, and despawns once no player is within 1 km (refunded as an intact truck). MES Escort.cs retreats a leaderless escort after WaypointWaitTimeTrigger (120 s on the escort autopilot), so every path leaves Escort or despawns before that. -->
		<EntityComponent xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_InventoryComponentDefinition">
			<Id>
				<TypeId>Inventory</TypeId>
				<SubtypeId>WW2-Convoy-Action-AssignSlot</SubtypeId>
